 "remarks": "2100 sqft Apartment*3 Bedrooms * 3 Full Baths * Home Office * Flexible Space for Guests or Extended Family * Off-Street Parking * Private Rooftop Deck * Pet-Friendly * In-Unit Laundry * Bicycle Storage * Dishwasher * Central Heating & Air Conditioning  Welcome to 41 Valley Road in Cos Cob! This spacious and inviting residence features three large bedrooms, three full bathrooms, a home office, and an additional flex room with a private area ideal for an au pair or guests.  The flexible layout includes beautiful hardwood floors, newer appliances, granite countertops, a wood-burning fireplace, and an in-unit washer and dryer. Central heating and air conditioning provide year-round comfort, while a private rooftop deck offers space to relax, entertain, and enjoy the outdoors.  Enjoy nearby parks, walking areas, restaurants, cafes, shops, and everyday conveniences, with opportunities for walking, jogging, and biking throughout the neighborhood. The nearby Cos Cob Metro-North station provides convenient access to Greenwich, Stamford, and New York City.  One parking space is included, bicycle storage is available, and small dogs are welcome. Clean, well maintained, and move-in ready, this home is available for an annual or short-term lease. Short-term rentals are offered at a premium. Please inquire for pricing and availability.Agent owner",
